{"id":"21507","t":{"th":"ม็อบไซโค 100 คนพลังจิต","ro":"Mob Psycho 100","en":"Mob Psycho 100","na":"モブサイコ100"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21507-6YUSbh2m0N1p.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21507-6YUSbh2m0N1p.jpg","color":"#d65d1a","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21507-Qx8bGsLXUgLo.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":12,"dur":24,"season":"SUMMER","year":2016,"start":"2016-07-12","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life","Supernatural"],"score":84,"pop":641824,"studio":"bones","desc":"Eighth-grader Shigeo \"Mob\" Kageyama has tapped into his inner wellspring of psychic prowess at a young age. But the power quickly proves to be a liability when he realizes the potential danger in his skills. Choosing to suppress his power, Mob's only present use for his ability is to impress his longtime crush, Tsubomi, who soon grows bored of the same tricks.\n\nIn order to effectuate control on his skills, Mob enlists himself under the wing of Arataka Reigen, a con artist claiming to be a psychic, who exploits Mob's powers for pocket change. Now, exorcising evil spirits on command has become a part of Mob's daily, monotonous life. However, the psychic energy he exerts is barely the tip of the iceberg; if his vast potential and unrestrained emotions run berserk, a cataclysmic event that would render him completely unrecognizable will be triggered. The progression toward Mob's explosion is rising and attempting to stop it is futile.","descTh":"เรื่องราวเกี่ยวกับ \"ม็อบ\" เด็กชายที่จะระเบิดถ้าความสามารถทางอารมณ์ของเขาถึง 100% เด็กหนุ่มผู้มีพลังจิตคนนี้ได้รับฉายาว่า \"ม็อบ\" เพราะเขาไม่โดดเด่นเหนือใคร เขาเก็บพลังจิตของเขาไว้เพื่อที่เขาจะได้ใช้ชีวิตได้ตามปกติ แต่ถ้าระดับอารมณ์ของเขาถึง 100 บางสิ่งบางอย่างก็จะครอบงำร่างกายของเขาทั้งหมด","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"mV39saBl